{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんは＊"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日も一日お疲れちまぁ( ^ω^ )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.higuchi/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hina.higuchi/img/2013/08/01/5053985/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"↑部屋着のひな。すっぴんちゃん笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"毎日、蒸暑いですね(>_<)\n体調復活したふぁむさん...良かったです♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"体調崩し気味のふぁむさん...美味しい物沢山食べて、しっかり身体を休めてくださいね(^^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"前回のブログコメントでは、最後の「日奈」のところは、漢字でも平仮名でも、その時の気分で良いよ！って言ってもらえたので、そうします♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとうございます( ^ω^ )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして語彙.読解力検定のおめでとうコメント、ありがとうございます＊\n本当は勉強不足でもあったので、自信はありませんでした(^_^;)\n今度は上位狙えるように頑張ります‼"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"先日、生写真の撮影終わりに渋谷のカフェで川後のひなさんとゆっくりお話ししました♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"久しぶりのWひなで、楽しかったです♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"よく、「普段は川後のひなさんのことを何て呼ぶの??川後?ひなぴょん?」と質問されるのですが..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"普段は「陽菜(ひな)！」って呼んでます♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもブログやトークの時は、ややこしくなってしまうかなと思い、川後のひなさんと呼んでいるのです...笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.higuchi/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hina.higuchi/img/2013/08/01/5053985/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Wひな♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、昨日はリハ終わりにせっちゃんと6駅歩きました(*^o^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.higuchi/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hina.higuchi/img/2013/08/01/5053985/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とっても疲れちゃったけど、良い運動になったし、せっちゃんとお話しもしながら歩けたので、良かったです*\\(^o^)/*"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"8月4日の全国握手会は、ななみんと一緒のレーン♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ななみんファミリーのみなさん、宜しくお願いします( ^ω^ )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひなちまふぁみりーのみなさん♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひなちまってますよぉ*\\(^o^)/*"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"【8月2日黒髪きんぎょさん】"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"☆HAPPY BIRTHDAY☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"素敵な一年になります様に☆*:.｡."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日も皆さんにとって幸せであります様に☆*:.｡."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大好き"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おひな"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"↑まさかのぉ～気分(^-^)にひひ"}],"source":"archive"}